IDENTIFIER PREFERENCE vs LIST-POSITION PREFERENCE
-------------------------------------------------
             top-1 RANK share by arm      top-1 ID share by arm       
  lfm2.5     1.00 1.00 1.00               0.25 0.32 0.50              
  qwen3.5    0.50 0.65 0.99               0.25 0.24 0.49              
  falcon     0.50 0.71 0.99               0.25 0.47 0.50              

  A model that holds a RANK constant while the ids under it change
  is position-driven. One that holds IDS constant while their rank
  moves is identifier-driven. Reported, not adjudicated: this is
  observational separation across three arms, not a manipulation.

